[{"client_msg_id":"bad8a53f-bbe3-4f3e-8f25-5fa1017e0a18","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"typeprof の language server ですが Gemfile や Rakefile も VSCode や Vim では ruby のファイルタイプになるので、それらを開いたときに反応してしまってエラー吐いてサーバーストップしてる症状があるかもしれません","ts":"1634112159.157400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qUlFB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e53e8a96-24cc-482e-a2f4-1ce0dbb3dcbb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Rails の numericality validator は、`50.` を数値ではないと判断するらしい","ts":"1634109369.157200","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","last_read":"1634117742.158900","subscribed":true,"reply_count":8,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CX7Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3242b4c2-c781-4ed0-93a5-adbfc85dd0c5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"一応 coc.nvim の typeprof の拡張の成果物、あげておきます。もし coc.nvim を使ってて。もし必要な方は参考にしてご自分で作ってメンテしてください \u003chttps://github.com/yaegassy/coc-typeprof\u003e","ts":"1634086902.156000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"yaegassy/coc-typeprof","id":1,"title":"yaegassy/coc-typeprof","text":"Ruby TypeProf extension for coc.nvim","fields":[{"title":"Language","value":"TypeScript","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"3 minutes ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qoz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c415c6e-e803-48cd-b150-bd8cb27c003b","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"実際、`Float`メソッドや`Integer`メソッドに`\"50.\"` を渡しても例外になるのでまあしょうがないのでは。","ts":"1634112610.157500","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bmdN1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9266178b-93fd-4c32-839e-994042bc5e4e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"しかし `'50.'.to_f` は通るのであった","ts":"1634112702.157700","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cc3+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbd758a9-6c9b-4a84-a574-d03a5ec76e58","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"to_f はそもそも末尾は無視しているのか","ts":"1634112747.157900","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UgTl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5f76f99-7e11-48bf-b057-c2b377086552","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"`'50.'.to_i`とかも通りますね。to_系メソッドは割と思い切りがよい印象。`'10 + hoge'.to_f` みたいなやつでも`10.0`が返ってくるので、","ts":"1634112831.158100","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o5A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15eda4b6-4f08-4d6c-8eac-a8b0fd6aa9a1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"先頭一致部分しか見てないみたいですね","ts":"1634112864.158300","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RiKmT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aae4b9cf-c786-4321-ace4-8fed14a3631f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそもの話は、フロントエンド側でのバリデーションがライブラリの内部で JS の `parseFloat()` を使っているらしく、`50.` みたいなやつも通っちゃってたんですけど、バックエンド側の Rails では弾かれてしまって、ロジックが統一されていなくてつらい、と言う感じでした…","ts":"1634113331.158500","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2UcTx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d395485-0df1-407e-8c17-f6e2aaed190a","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"なるほど…\nカスタムバリデーターを作るのが一つの作戦な気はしてきました。一旦文字列で末尾のドットを削除してから数値検証をするような。","ts":"1634117698.158700","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0c/Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c023795-8882-406b-8003-46b8d9455d97","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どうしてもやるならそうなりますよね。めんどいーw","ts":"1634117742.158900","thread_ts":"1634109369.157200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["UCFEJF487"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2UvD4"}]}]
